<title>ITALY: CYCLING-TOUR OF SARDINIA SECOND STAGE TIMES/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-TOUR OF SARDINIA SECOND STAGE TIMES/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>ORISTANO, Sardinia 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading times in the</p>
<p>184-km second stage of the Tour of Sardinia cycle race on</p>
<p>Thursday (Italians unless stated):</p>
<p>1. Alessandro Bertolini   4 hours 36 minutes 20 seconds</p>
<p>2. Jan Svorada (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>3. Vyacheslav Djavanian (Russia)</p>
<p>4. Gianluca Gorini</p>
<p>5. Massimiliano Mori</p>
<p>6. Alessio Barbagli</p>
<p>7. Gabriele Balducci</p>
<p>8. Fulvio Frigo</p>
<p>9. Vasily Davidenko (Russia)</p>
<p>10. Fausto Dotti		all same time as Bertolini</p>
<p>Leading standings:</p>
<p>  1. Bertolini		8 hours 54 minutes 46 seconds</p>
<p>  2. Armin Meier (Switzerland)  3 seconds behind</p>
<p>  3. Svorada			  4 seconds</p>
<p>  4. Gabriele Missaglia	   5</p>
<p>  5. Djavanian			6</p>
<p>  6. Roberto Petito		 7</p>
<p>  7. Michele Coppolillo	   8</p>
<p>  8. Mori			    10</p>
<p>  9. Balducci		     </p>
<p>  10. Frigo			   both same time as Mori</p>
</text>
